# The deployment root is the REPO root, not `web/` — see vercel.json.
#
# That is not a preference. `web/app/policy/page.tsx` reads
# `process.cwd()/../policy/policy.yaml`, and `web/next.config.mjs` sets
# `outputFileTracingRoot` to the repo root for the same reason: there is exactly
# one policy file and the page that publishes the rules must be reading the file
# the gate enforces. Deploying `web/` alone put that file outside the upload,
# which is what made the first attempt fail with a doubled `path0/path0` output
# path — Next traced above its own deployment root.
#
# So the whole repo goes up, and everything the site does not need comes off
# here rather than being copied into `web/` and drifting.

api/
tests/
stories/
docs/
stamp-system-design-handoff/
MEMORY/
.remember/
*.zip
*.mp4
